## 🎯 Objectives & Key Achievements
In this lab, I practiced implementing cost management strategies and setting up cost guardrails within Microsoft Azure to prevent unexpected cloud spending.

### Key Learnings:
- **Azure Budgets:** Configured cloud budget thresholds and alert notifications for proactive cost management.
- **Cost Analysis:** Used Azure Cost Management tools to analyze and forecast cloud infrastructure spending.
- **Resource Tagging / Governance:** Applied cost control policies and guardrails to maintain operational efficiency.

